	(text "RIGHT MAG ONLY: JG2, 100mA accessory target; 210k 1% limit approx 109..152mA.\nU8 latches OFF on fault; Q3 DET clamp prevents enabling an absent accessory.\nQ7 and Q9 rapidly clamp EN when MAG_ENABLE is LOW; R26 gives default OFF.\nQ4/Q6 common-drain IRQ isolation follows switched/Core domains separately.\nDET must be a passive contact to GND. TCA4307 and external pull-ups use switched 3V3.\nLeft MAG circuit removed; side spring-return control has no assigned pins or function.\nNo Core-to-ISO connection. ESD and startup load/capacitance need system qualification."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
